 SG_ SteeringAngle : 7|16@0- (0.1,0) [-780|780] "deg" CANLAB

BO_ 2147484416 EnvironmentExtended: 8 CANLAB
 SG_ AmbientTemperature : 0|8@1- (1,-40) [-40|215] "deg C" CANLAB
